      "text": "Look closely at America's first spacesuit in nineteen sixty-one. Wrapped in mirror-bright aluminized nylon, it was only an emergency pressure cocoon. Inflated in vacuum, its fabric joints locked so stiff an astronaut could barely bend an elbow.",
