      "seg_id": "N02",
      "text": "Four years later, Project Gemini pushed astronauts outside into raw vacuum. Tethered by a twenty-five-foot golden umbilical hose, Ed White floated over Earth firing a handheld gas gun. Yet internal pressure ballooned soft Gemini suits like car tires, nearly exhausting crews squeezing back inside.",
