    {
      "seg_id": "N03",
      "text": "Walking on the Moon in nineteen sixty-nine demanded a wearable twenty-one-layer spacecraft. Beneath fireproof white Beta-cloth, stacked Mylar and ballistic armor stopped tiny space rocks at eight kilometers per second. A thin gold-plated visor reflected blinding, unfiltered sunlight.",
