      "text": "In nineteen eighty-four, NASA rebuilt the upper body around a rigid fiberglass shell. Snapped onto a twenty-four-thruster nitrogen jetpack, Bruce McCandless flew untethered one hundred meters from Challenger. He became a standalone human satellite above Earth.",
